<view class="page-shell fields-page">
  <view class="fields-hero">
    <view class="page-title">选课字段解释</view>
    <view class="page-subtitle">集中说明 Master Class Schedule 与 AIMS 中常见的 16 项字段。</view>
  </view>

  <view class="important-note">
    <text>容易混淆</text>
    <view>CRN 是教学班注册编号；Section 是班次编号；WEB 表示网页注册权限，不代表线上授课。</view>
  </view>

  <view class="field-group" wx:for="{{fieldGroups}}" wx:for-item="group" wx:key="title">
    <view class="section-heading">{{group.title}}</view>
    <view class="surface field-list">
      <view class="field-item" wx:for="{{group.fields}}" wx:for-item="field" wx:key="term">
        <view class="field-head">
          <view class="field-term">
            <text>{{field.term}}</text>
            <text wx:if="{{field.fullName}}">{{field.fullName}}</text>
          </view>
          <view class="field-meaning">{{field.meaning}}</view>
        </view>
        <view class="field-description">{{field.description}}</view>
      </view>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="source-note">字段解释用于辅助阅读课程班次。课程名额和注册状态会持续变化，最终请以 AIMS 为准。</view>
</view>
